diff --git a/CONTRIBUTING.md b/CONTRIBUTING.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..da16f2a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CONTRIBUTING.md
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# Contributing
+
+Contributions are welcome. Keep the trusted core small, deterministic and testable.
+
+- Run `go test ./...` and `go vet ./...`.
+- Add tests for every security or transaction behavior change.
+- Do not add unrestricted shell execution to theme packages.
+- New desktop adapters must document the exact versions/session types tested in reality.
+- New Commons licenses require review; do not broaden the allowlist casually.
+- Preserve attribution and remix ancestry in examples and fixtures.
diff --git a/CREDITS.md b/CREDITS.md
new file mode 100644
