--- /dev/null
+++ b/CREDITS.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Credits
+
+**Linux Desktop Customizer** was conceived and directed by **JP99**, including the product idea, visual direction, privacy model, community/remix philosophy and signature-theme concepts.
+
+The software and theme foundation was engineered collaboratively with **GPT-5.6 Sol by OpenAI** as an AI engineering assistant under JP99's direction. The six official signature themes are original project assets. Mac Inspired and Windows Inspired are independent, unaffiliated Linux themes and do not contain vendor branding.
+
+Community contributions retain their own authorship and provenance. Remixes must preserve attribution and license information required by their source components.
